        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>小学生1-6年级必背古诗 一年级·下册</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #f2c14e;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      45deg, #fdf3d0 0px, #fdf3d0 2px, #fbe9b8 2px, #fbe9b8 4px\n    ), #fdf3d0;\n    border: 3px dashed #e8a33d;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 14px 16px 20px 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .title-banner {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffb27a 0%, #ff8a3d 100%);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n  }\n  .title-banner .t1 {\n    color: #ff3d7f;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n  }\n  .title-banner .t2 {\n    color: #7a2b00;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n  }\n  .subtitle-wrap {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #e8443c, #c8241f);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 5px 22px;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .row.two .poem-block {\n    width: 48%;\n  }\n  .row.three .poem-block {\n    width: 31%;\n  }\n  .poem-block {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .poem-title {\n    color: #ff3d7f;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .poem-author {\n    color: #7a5a2e;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .poem-line {\n    color: #333;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .row.three .poem-line {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n  }\n  .divider-space {\n    height: 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-banner\">\n    <span class=\"t1\">小学生1-6年级</span><span class=\"t2\">必背古诗</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"subtitle-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"subtitle\">一年级 · 下册</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row two\">\n    <div class=\"poem-block\">\n      <div class=\"poem-title\">《春晓》</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-author\">【唐】孟浩然</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-line\">春眠不觉晓，<br>处处闻啼鸟。<br>夜来风雨声，<br>花落知多少。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"poem-block\">\n      <div class=\"poem-title\">《赠汪伦》</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-author\">【唐】李白</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-line\">李白乘舟将欲行，<br>忽闻岸上踏歌声。<br>桃花潭水深千尺，<br>不及汪伦送我情。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row three\">\n    <div class=\"poem-block\">\n      <div class=\"poem-title\">《静夜思》</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-author\">【唐】李白</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-line\">床前明月光，<br>疑是地上霜。<br>举头望明月，<br>低头思故乡。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"poem-block\">\n      <div class=\"poem-title\">《寻隐者不遇》</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-author\">【唐】贾岛</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-line\">松下问童子，<br>言师采药去。<br>只在此山中，<br>云深不知处。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"poem-block\">\n      <div class=\"poem-title\">《池上》</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-author\">【唐】白居易</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-line\">小娃撑小艇，<br>偷采白莲回。<br>不解藏踪迹，<br>浮萍一道开。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row two\">\n    <div class=\"poem-block\">\n      <div class=\"poem-title\">《小池》</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-author\">【宋】杨万里</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-line\">泉眼无声惜细流，<br>树荫照水爱晴柔。<br>小荷才露尖尖角，<br>早有蜻蜓立上头。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"poem-block\">\n      <div class=\"poem-title\">《画鸡》</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-author\">【明】唐寅</div>\n      <div class=\"poem-line\">头上红冠不用裁，<br>满身雪白走将来。<br>平生不敢轻言语，<br>一叫千门万户开。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
